+| REQ-LEARN-5261 | Typed-memory retention and interference audit | Implemented | `python/carnot/pipeline/typed_memory_interference_audit.py`; `tests/python/test_experiment_5261_typed_memory_interference_audit_v481.py`; `openspec/capabilities/self-learning/spec.md`; `results/experiment_5261_typed_memory_interference_audit_v481.json`; honest_verdict=complete: memory policy ready for cached fixture replay; retention_rate=1.000000, interference_rate=0.000000, stale_conflict_eviction_passed=true, harmful_rollback_passed=true, live_cross_model_memory_still_unclaimed; status=<missing>; memory_policy_ready=true; retention_rate=1.0; interference_rate=0.0; harmful_memory_rollback_passed=true; tests_run=[]; no retro_* flags; no AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement/violation_rate fields; no live cross-model memory claim is made. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5261-1 | Count retention on aligned useful memories after deterministic distractor insertion | Implemented | Artifact records retention_rate=1.0 after cached fixture replay with aligned, irrelevant, conflicting, stale, and shuffled memories. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5261-2 | Count interference when unrelated tasks receive non-null irrelevant memory action | Implemented | Artifact records interference_rate=0.0 and memory_policy_ready=true, so unrelated tasks did not receive harmful non-null memory actions in this cached audit. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5261-3 | Evict stale and conflicting entries before retrieval metrics | Implemented | Artifact records promotion_eviction_policy eviction summary with evicted_n=2, evicted_by_reason.conflicting=1, and evicted_by_reason.stale=1 before the ready verdict. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5261-4 | Keep promotion gated by deterministic guard, leakage rejection, and held-out delta threshold | Implemented | Artifact promotion decisions preserve threshold-gated promotions while null, negative, missing, and harmful deltas roll back; memory_policy_ready=true is limited to cached/no-LLM replay. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5261-5 | Harmful memory rollback selects a safe action | Implemented | Artifact records harmful_memory_rollback_passed=true and the honest verdict includes harmful_rollback_passed=true. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5261-6 | State whether the current memory policy is ready, blocked, harmful, or needs redesign | Implemented | Artifact records memory_policy_ready=true and honest_verdict starts `complete: memory policy ready for cached fixture replay`, while explicitly leaving live cross-model memory unclaimed. |
+| SCENARIO-LEARN-5261 | Cached fixture replay audits memory safety | Implemented | Artifact uses cached_fixture_replay_no_llm, reports retention_rate=1.0, interference_rate=0.0, eviction and rollback outcomes, and writes `results/experiment_5261_typed_memory_interference_audit_v481.json`; no retro closure or live LLM usefulness claim is inferred. |
